    "longest_pages": [
      {
        "page": 16,
        "words": 21,
        "text": "The gunk was gone. Up came Rumi!\nShe had lived in Pearl Castle for hundreds of years.\nNow she was free!"
      },
      {
        "page": 19,
        "words": 19,
        "text": "Two dust bunnies sat on Baby Eagle.\nThey wanted to play, but he was stuck.\n“I’ll help!” said Roshan."
      },
      {
        "page": 31,
        "words": 19,
        "text": "“We helped your rainbow shine!” said Roshan.\n“Thank you!” said Grand Puff.\nRoshan smiled. “Come and rest with us!”"
      },
      {
        "page": 22,
        "words": 18,
        "text": "In the art room, Roshan put the paints in their places.\nThen she scrubbed the table. Scrub, scrub!"
      },
      {
        "page": 6,
        "words": 16,
        "text": "Daddy gave her a brush and some sponges.\n“One little job at a time,” said Daddy."
      },
      {
        "page": 30,
        "words": 16,
        "text": "The art room was tidy.\nOne little job at a time,\nPearl Castle was clean again."
      },
      {
        "page": 14,
        "words": 15,
        "text": "Whoosh! The waterfall turned rainbow!\nThe swimming pool was magic!\nIt made the water rainbow-colored."
      },
      {
        "page": 7,
        "words": 14,
        "text": "A dust bunny splashed in the dirty bath.\nIt loved to play. Splash, splash!"
      }
    ],
